{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6f2c1a9e-4b7d-4e3a-9c5f-8d2e4a7b1c30",
    "name": "多商户订单系统 - Order API",
    "description": "App-ID + 签名鉴权（sign 放请求体里）。签名逻辑写在 Collection 级别的 Pre-request Script 里，对本 Collection 下所有请求自动生效，不需要每个请求单独配置。\n\n使用前先在 Environment 里填好 base_url / app_id / api_key / group_key（这几个值在系统后台「应用管理」「支付组」里能找到）。\n\n可选：payment_method_key（后台「支付方式」的 method_code）。填了之后，仅对请求体里已经带有 payment_method_key 字段的请求生效（即「创建订单 - 指定支付渠道」那个示例），用来跳过支付组路由与限额风控；此时请求体里的 notify_url / return_url / cancel_url 必须改成该支付方式绑定的站点域名，否则会被 PAYMENT_METHOD_DOMAIN_MISMATCH 拒单。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "last_order_no", "value": "" },
    { "key": "last_merchant_order_no", "value": "" },
    { "key": "last_payment_link_token", "value": "" }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// ============================================================",
          "// 统一签名脚本：对 Collection 下所有请求生效。",
          "//",
          "// 【重要】签名字段一律不要写成 {{变量}} 放在请求体文本里 ——",
          "// Postman 对 body 里的 {{}} 做变量替换发生在这个脚本执行完之后，",
          "// 如果签名时用的是还没替换的占位符文本，和实际发出去的字节不一致，",
          "// 服务端验签必然失败。需要动态值的地方（如 group_key、",
          "// merchant_order_no）都在下面用 JS 直接改 bodyObj，不依赖模板替换。",
          "// ============================================================",
          "",
          "const appId = pm.environment.get('app_id');",
          "const apiKey = pm.environment.get('api_key');",
          "",
          "if (!appId || !apiKey) {",
          "    console.warn('请先在当前 Environment 里配置 app_id 和 api_key');",
          "}",
          "",
          "let bodyObj = {};",
          "if (pm.request.body && pm.request.body.mode === 'raw' && pm.request.body.raw) {",
          "    try {",
          "        bodyObj = JSON.parse(pm.request.body.raw);",
          "    } catch (e) {",
          "        bodyObj = {};",
          "    }",
          "}",
          "",
          "// 用 Environment 里配置的 group_key 覆盖请求体里写死的示例值，",
          "// 方便切换商户/支付组测试时不用逐个改请求体文本",
          "const envGroupKey = pm.environment.get('group_key');",
          "if (envGroupKey && Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(bodyObj, 'group_key')) {",
          "    bodyObj.group_key = envGroupKey;",
          "}",
          "",
          "// payment_method_key（指定支付渠道）同理：只对请求体里已经带了这个字段的请求生效，",
          "// 避免把普通下单请求也误改成指定渠道模式（那样三个回跳地址会变成必填，",
          "// 而且域名还要和渠道绑定站点一致）。",
          "const envPaymentMethodKey = pm.environment.get('payment_method_key');",
          "if (envPaymentMethodKey && Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(bodyObj, 'payment_method_key')) {",
          "    bodyObj.payment_method_key = envPaymentMethodKey;",
          "}",
          "",
          "// merchant_order_no 写 \"AUTO\" 时自动生成一个基于时间戳的唯一值，",
          "// 避免每次跑集合都因为幂等机制（同一 merchant_order_no 返回同一订单）而拿到旧数据。",
          "// 如果是故意要测试幂等性，把请求体里的 merchant_order_no 改成一个固定字符串，",
          "// 连续跑两次，应该会收到一模一样的 order_no。",
          "if (bodyObj.merchant_order_no === 'AUTO') {",
          "    bodyObj.merchant_order_no = 'TEST' + Date.now();",
          "}",
          "",
          "delete bodyObj.sign;",
          "",
          "// 规范化编码：关联数组（对象）按 key 递归排序，数组保持原顺序。",
          "// 必须和服务端 App\\Http\\Middleware\\ApiAuthentication::canonicalize() 逐字节一致。",
          "function ksortRecursive(value) {",
          "    if (Array.isArray(value)) {",
          "        return value.map(ksortRecursive);",
          "    }",
          "    if (value !== null && typeof value === 'object') {",
          "        const sorted = {};",
          "        Object.keys(value).sort().forEach(function (k) {",
          "            sorted[k] = ksortRecursive(value[k]);",
          "        });",
          "        return sorted;",
          "    }",
          "    return value;",
          "}",
          "",
          "const canonicalBody = JSON.stringify(ksortRecursive(bodyObj));",
          "const timestamp = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000).toString();",
          "const nonce = CryptoJS.lib.WordArray.random(16).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
          "",
          "const stringToSign = appId + '\\n' + timestamp + '\\n' + nonce + '\\n' + canonicalBody;",
          "const sign = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(stringToSign, apiKey).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex);",
          "",
          "bodyObj.sign = sign;",
          "",
          "// 写回去的是最终确定、不再含任何 {{占位符}} 的完整 JSON 文本，",
          "// 之后 Postman 的变量替换找不到东西可替换，签名和实际发送字节保持一致。",
          "if (pm.request.body && pm.request.body.mode === 'raw') {",
          "    pm.request.body.raw = JSON.stringify(bodyObj);",
          "}",
          "",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'App-ID', value: appId });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Timestamp', value: timestamp });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'X-Nonce', value: nonce });",
          "pm.request.headers.upsert({ key: 'Content-Type', value: 'application/json' });",
          "",
          "console.log('StringToSign:', stringToSign);",
          "console.log('Sign:', sign);"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "订单管理",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "创建订单（happy path）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('code === 0', function () { pm.expect(json.code).to.eql(0); });",
                  "",
                  "if (json && json.data) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('last_order_no', json.data.order_no);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('last_payment_link_token', json.data.payment_link_token);",
                  "    console.log('order_no:', json.data.order_no);",
                  "    console.log('payment_url:', json.data.payment_url);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchant_order_no\": \"AUTO\",\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n  \"group_key\": \"group_default\",\n  \"platform\": \"wordpress\",\n  \"subtotal\": \"180.00\",\n  \"shipping_fee\": \"15.00\",\n  \"discount\": \"10.00\",\n  \"tax\": \"5.00\",\n  \"amount\": \"190.00\",\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"first_name\": \"John\",\n    \"last_name\": \"Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+4915112345678\"\n  },\n  \"shipping_address\": {\n    \"line1\": \"Alexanderplatz 1\",\n    \"line2\": \"Apt. 4B\",\n    \"city\": \"Berlin\",\n    \"state\": \"Berlin\",\n    \"country\": \"DE\",\n    \"zip\": \"10178\"\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"product_sku\": \"SKU-1001\",\n      \"product_id\": \"WP-1001\",\n      \"product_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/product/mechanical-keyboard\",\n      \"product_name\": \"Mechanical Keyboard\",\n      \"product_description\": \"Blue switches, RGB backlight\",\n      \"unit_price\": \"90.00\",\n      \"quantity\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notify_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/api/payment/callback\",\n  \"return_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/order/success\",\n  \"cancel_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/order/cancel\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/order/create",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["order", "create"]
            },
            "description": "180.00(小计) + 15.00(运费) - 10.00(折扣) + 5.00(税) = 190.00，和 amount 对得上，走正常成功路径。\n\nmerchant_order_no 写 \"AUTO\"，Pre-request Script 会自动换成基于时间戳的唯一值，避免重复跑集合时命中幂等逻辑返回旧订单。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "创建订单 - 幂等测试（连续跑两次应返回同一订单）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchant_order_no\": \"IDEMPOTENCY-TEST-0001\",\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n  \"group_key\": \"group_default\",\n  \"platform\": \"wordpress\",\n  \"subtotal\": \"180.00\",\n  \"shipping_fee\": \"15.00\",\n  \"discount\": \"10.00\",\n  \"tax\": \"5.00\",\n  \"amount\": \"190.00\",\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"first_name\": \"John\",\n    \"last_name\": \"Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+4915112345678\"\n  },\n  \"shipping_address\": {\n    \"line1\": \"Alexanderplatz 1\",\n    \"line2\": \"Apt. 4B\",\n    \"city\": \"Berlin\",\n    \"state\": \"Berlin\",\n    \"country\": \"DE\",\n    \"zip\": \"10178\"\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"product_sku\": \"SKU-1001\",\n      \"product_id\": \"WP-1001\",\n      \"product_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/product/mechanical-keyboard\",\n      \"product_name\": \"Mechanical Keyboard\",\n      \"product_description\": \"Blue switches, RGB backlight\",\n      \"unit_price\": \"90.00\",\n      \"quantity\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notify_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/api/payment/callback\",\n  \"return_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/order/success\",\n  \"cancel_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/order/cancel\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/order/create",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["order", "create"]
            },
            "description": "merchant_order_no 是固定字符串（不是 AUTO），第一次跑会真的创建订单，第二次跑应该收到完全相同的 order_no —— 这是在验证 2.2 节的幂等性铁律（联合唯一索引 + 命中直接返回已存在订单）。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "创建订单 - 金额不符（预期 422 AMOUNT_MISMATCH）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 422', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(422); });",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('error_code === AMOUNT_MISMATCH', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.error_code).to.eql('AMOUNT_MISMATCH');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchant_order_no\": \"AUTO\",\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n  \"group_key\": \"group_default\",\n  \"platform\": \"wordpress\",\n  \"subtotal\": \"180.00\",\n  \"shipping_fee\": \"15.00\",\n  \"discount\": \"10.00\",\n  \"tax\": \"5.00\",\n  \"amount\": \"999.99\",\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"first_name\": \"John\",\n    \"last_name\": \"Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+4915112345678\"\n  },\n  \"shipping_address\": {\n    \"line1\": \"Alexanderplatz 1\",\n    \"line2\": \"Apt. 4B\",\n    \"city\": \"Berlin\",\n    \"state\": \"Berlin\",\n    \"country\": \"DE\",\n    \"zip\": \"10178\"\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"product_sku\": \"SKU-1001\",\n      \"product_id\": \"WP-1001\",\n      \"product_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/product/mechanical-keyboard\",\n      \"product_name\": \"Mechanical Keyboard\",\n      \"product_description\": \"Blue switches, RGB backlight\",\n      \"unit_price\": \"90.00\",\n      \"quantity\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notify_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/api/payment/callback\",\n  \"return_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/order/success\",\n  \"cancel_url\": \"https://merchant.example.com/order/cancel\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/order/create",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["order", "create"]
            },
            "description": "故意把 amount 改成 999.99，和 subtotal+shipping_fee-discount+tax(=190.00) 对不上，应该触发 2.1 节的金额公式铁律拒单。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "创建订单 - 指定支付渠道（payment_method_key）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200（成功）或 422（渠道/域名不匹配）', function () {",
                  "    pm.expect([200, 422]).to.include(pm.response.code);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const requested = JSON.parse(pm.request.body.raw).payment_method_key;",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    pm.test('锁定的支付方式就是指定的渠道', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(json.data.payment_method).to.eql(requested);",
                  "    });",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('last_order_no', json.data.order_no);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('last_payment_link_token', json.data.payment_link_token);",
                  "    console.log('order_no:', json.data.order_no, 'pay_url:', json.data.pay_url);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    pm.test('422 时错误码与指定渠道相关', function () {",
                  "        pm.expect(['PAYMENT_METHOD_NOT_AVAILABLE', 'PAYMENT_METHOD_DOMAIN_MISMATCH', 'CALLBACK_DOMAIN_NOT_ALLOWED']).to.include(json.error_code);",
                  "    });",
                  "    console.warn('拒单：', json.error_code, json.msg);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"merchant_order_no\": \"AUTO\",\n  \"currency\": \"EUR\",\n  \"group_key\": \"group_default\",\n  \"platform\": \"wordpress\",\n  \"payment_method_key\": \"paypal\",\n  \"subtotal\": \"180.00\",\n  \"shipping_fee\": \"15.00\",\n  \"discount\": \"10.00\",\n  \"tax\": \"5.00\",\n  \"amount\": \"190.00\",\n  \"customer\": {\n    \"first_name\": \"John\",\n    \"last_name\": \"Doe\",\n    \"email\": \"john.doe@example.com\",\n    \"phone\": \"+4915112345678\"\n  },\n  \"shipping_address\": {\n    \"line1\": \"Alexanderplatz 1\",\n    \"line2\": \"Apt. 4B\",\n    \"city\": \"Berlin\",\n    \"state\": \"Berlin\",\n    \"country\": \"DE\",\n    \"zip\": \"10178\"\n  },\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"product_sku\": \"SKU-1001\",\n      \"product_id\": \"WP-1001\",\n      \"product_url\": \"https://shop.example.com/product/mechanical-keyboard\",\n      \"product_name\": \"Mechanical Keyboard\",\n      \"product_description\": \"Blue switches, RGB backlight\",\n      \"unit_price\": \"90.00\",\n      \"quantity\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notify_url\": \"https://shop.example.com/wp-json/my-plugin/v1/webhook\",\n  \"return_url\": \"https://shop.example.com/checkout/order-received/123/\",\n  \"cancel_url\": \"https://shop.example.com/cart/\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/order/create",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["order", "create"]
            },
            "description": "指定支付渠道示例：payment_method_key 传后台「支付方式」的 method_code（这里写的是 paypal）。传了这个参数后，系统不再在支付组里做加权均匀分配，也不再校验单笔/当日金额/当日笔数/当月金额这些限额，直接用这个渠道建单（group_key 仍然必填）。\n\n代价：notify_url / return_url / cancel_url 三个地址必须全部传齐，且域名要与该支付方式绑定的「网站域名」一致（比较时忽略大小写、www. 前缀与端口）。跑之前先把示例里的 shop.example.com 换成你自己站点的域名，把 payment_method_key 换成真实的 method_code（也可以只填 Environment 里的 payment_method_key 变量，Pre-request Script 会覆盖请求体里的值）。\n\n域名对不上会得到 422 PAYMENT_METHOD_DOMAIN_MISMATCH，渠道不存在/不属于该商户/已停用会得到 422 PAYMENT_METHOD_NOT_AVAILABLE，两种情况都不会创建订单。另外这些回跳地址的域名还必须与下单所用应用绑定的网站域名一致，否则同样会被拒（CALLBACK_DOMAIN_NOT_ALLOWED）。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "查询订单 - 按 order_no",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/order/query?order_no={{last_order_no}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["order", "query"],
              "query": [{ "key": "order_no", "value": "{{last_order_no}}" }]
            },
            "description": "order_no 取自「创建订单（happy path）」请求的 Test Script 存下来的 collection 变量，先跑那个请求再跑这个。\n\nGET 请求也带了一个 body（只有签名需要，query 参数不受影响），因为 /order/query 走的是同一套 api.auth 中间件，同样要求 body 里有 sign 字段。"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "查询订单 - 按 merchant_order_no",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/order/query?merchant_order_no=IDEMPOTENCY-TEST-0001",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["order", "query"],
              "query": [{ "key": "merchant_order_no", "value": "IDEMPOTENCY-TEST-0001" }]
            },
            "description": "配合上面的幂等测试请求一起用，查一下那个固定 merchant_order_no 对应的订单状态。"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
